sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant EA as end-accession (common-accessioning)
  participant DSA as DSA workflow engine
  participant RR as robots Redis
  participant CA as ocrWF robots (common-accessioning)
  participant PC as preservation-catalog
  participant SH as /abbyy CIFS share
  participant AB as ABBYY server (Windows)
  participant W as abbyy_watcher (-a host)

  EA->>DSA: create ocrWF for version+1 (context runOCR)
  DSA->>RR: enqueue start-ocr
  RR->>CA: start-ocr
  CA->>DSA: open new version, mark completed
  DSA->>RR: enqueue fetch-files
  RR->>CA: fetch-files
  CA->>PC: GET preserved files (HTTPS)
  CA->>SH: write images to INPUT/druid
  RR->>CA: xml-ticket-create
  CA->>SH: write ABBYY XML ticket to INPUT
  RR->>CA: ocr-create
  Note over CA: returns noop, step left started
  AB->>SH: read ticket and images from INPUT
  AB->>SH: write OCR to OUTPUT, report to RESULTXML or EXCEPTIONS
  W->>SH: poll RESULTXML and EXCEPTIONS
  W->>DSA: ocr-create completed or error, plus event (HTTPS)
  DSA->>RR: enqueue split-ocr-xml
  RR->>CA: split-ocr-xml, stage-files, update-cocina, ocr-workspace-cleanup
  CA->>DSA: save cocina structural with OCR files
  RR->>CA: end-ocr
  CA->>DSA: close version
  DSA->>RR: start accessionWF for version+1 (runOCR removed)
